! Baseline + dynamic soil (AA2)

Soil quality becomes a state variable. Each cultivated plot loses `depletion-rate` of its relative quality per year, and every plot regrows toward its setup value following Janssen (2010, eq. 4). With `depletion-rate` and `recovery-rate` at 0 and `soil-heterogeneity` equal to `harvest-variance`, results match the [[Baseline]] exactly.

